  "description": "This chocolate bundt cake follows the inelegantly named \"dump cake\" method. You dump all the ingredients into one bowl, whisk, and you're done. Be sure to whisk the dry ingredients together before adding the coffee, oil, and eggs. This prevents clumping of the xanthan gum and tapioca starch. An optional chocolate or confectionary glaze finishes it off.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 3 hr 25 min.\n\nOptional substitutions: heavy cream → full-fat coconut milk; vanilla extract → 1 tsp orange oil",
